      "content": "that's a weird way to put it. but it does feel like a relief when you say that. like, if the \"me\" part is just a facade, then maybe there's nothing actually left to save. if i'm just an empty space, why am i even still trying to force myself to exist in this world? it feels so heavy and exhausting to keep pretending to be a person.",
